{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "task_family": "incremental_english_modern_japanese_overlay",
  "book_id": "rashomon-stories",
  "chunk_id": "rashomon-stories-chunk-0133",
  "units": [
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00133",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "内藏助心里如是想，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "This was what Kuranosuke thought in his heart,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00133",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "他对别人称赞自己装疯卖傻的行为感到不快，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "so it was only natural that he felt displeased when others praised his act of pretending to be mad,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00133",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "也就顺理成章了。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "and that was perfectly understandable.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00133",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "他觉得，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "He felt that",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00133",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "吹拂在心里的最后一点春风，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "the last faint spring breeze that had been blowing through his heart",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00133",
      "unit_index": 6,
      "source_text": "经此打击一点温暖都没有了。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "had lost every trace of warmth after this blow.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00133",
      "unit_index": 7,
      "source_text": "如今他心里只剩下冰冷的阴影了。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Now only a cold shadow remained in his heart.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00133",
      "unit_index": 8,
      "source_text": "他不喜欢被误解，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "He did not like being misunderstood,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00133",
      "unit_index": 9,
      "source_text": "同时又因为这种误解在自己意料之外，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "and at the same time, because this misunderstanding had been beyond anything he expected,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00133",
      "unit_index": 10,
      "source_text": "而对自己的无能和愚蠢也感觉沮丧。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "he also felt dejected by his own incompetence and foolishness.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00133",
      "unit_index": 11,
      "source_text": "他的复仇壮举，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "His great act of revenge,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00133",
      "unit_index": 12,
      "source_text": "他的同伴，还有他本人，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "his comrades, and even he himself",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00133",
      "unit_index": 13,
      "source_text": "可能会因着这种随意的赞扬而流芳百世吧。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "might perhaps be remembered for generations because of this careless praise.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00133",
      "unit_index": 14,
      "source_text": "——想到这令人不快的事情，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Thinking of this unpleasant matter,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00133",
      "unit_index": 15,
      "source_text": "他把手放在就要熄灭的炭火上烘着，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "he held his hands over the charcoal fire that was about to go out, warming them,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00133",
      "unit_index": 16,
      "source_text": "没再看传右卫门的眼神，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "no longer looking at Denemon's eyes,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00133",
      "unit_index": 17,
      "source_text": "凄凉的叹了一口气。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "and gave a desolate sigh.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
